{"agent":"build","type":"msg","text":"Extended natural-prose general registry with research-verified techniques (#6-11): ground every abstraction, show-don't-tell concrete scene, personal voice/lived experience, intentional burstiness, committed position/stance, defined point of view. Added mechanical anti-tell pass (em-dash rule, not-just-X-but-Y, AI vocab) and an \"existing agents/tools\" cross-reference table (blader/humanizer, harshaneel/humanize, nicojan/humanize-text-prompt, Wikipedia Signs of AI writing, Palahniuk, Nguyen, Surfer). All sources live-fetched and verified. General + scientific registries now both carry the \"human voice = specificity + stance + teaching/voice\" core.","id":"laptop-p16:73","host":"laptop-p16","seq":73,"ts":"2026-08-14T11:58:19.507Z"}
