{"agent":"build","type":"msg","text":"Corrected the \"teaching tone\" framing per user clarification: goal is NOT textbook-style exposition. Reframed as phrase-level reader-guidance — linking phrases, introductions, transitions that invite learning and steer the reader through a FOCUSED artifact (\"to see why note that...\", \"here's why this matters\", \"so what changes if...\"). Applied to both scientific (#6) and general (#12) registries, with explicit \"don't open out into a lecture / stays focused\" guardrails. Updated reach-limits and parallelism sections to match.","id":"laptop-p16:77","host":"laptop-p16","seq":77,"ts":"2026-08-14T12:01:54.236Z"}
