{"agent":"build","type":"msg","text":"Created shared reference references/reader-guidance-phrases.md — a curated, NON-EXHAUSTIVE repertoire of reader-guidance linking phrases (mark pivot, orient/signpost, invite attention, manage tension, resume thread). Explicitly framed as illustrative models of function, not a closed vocabulary, with anti-pattern table (formulaic AI transitions) and usage rules (one per boundary, name the thing, vary grammar, light touch, never in formal envs). Wired both natural-prose-auditor and natural-prose-naturalizer to load it; both carry explicit \"non-exhaustive — invent your own phrase, don't paste from a menu\" instruction. Registries #6 (scientific) and #12 (general) now point to it instead of duplicating inline examples.","id":"laptop-p16:83","host":"laptop-p16","seq":83,"ts":"2026-08-14T12:03:45.576Z"}
